<view class="launch">
  <view class="brand" bindlongpress="switchDevRole">
    <view class="brand-mark">CQ</view>
    <view class="brand-name">{{clientName}}</view>
    <view class="brand-subtitle">训练交付小程序</view>
  </view>

  <status-view
    state="{{state}}"
    title="{{title}}"
    message="{{message}}"
    action-text="{{actionText}}"
    bindaction="retry"
  />

  <view class="notice">
    身份由俱乐部档案和微信绑定结果决定。家长和教练入口不会在小程序内手动选择。
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{devHint}}" class="dev-hint">{{devHint}}</view>
</view>
